    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749340/extras/3dc450f96baa70a7ae14659f678c2c25.avif?t=1733388300\" width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the latest parish council meeting we have unanimously agreed that you are to be editor-in-chief of our  community newsletter &quot;Jobsworth Weekly&quot;. Adhere to the publishing guidelines and make decisions with great consideration for the future of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A true slice of Middle England</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749340/extras/a2856562d7cf7676ef9ddc735cf38131.avif?t=1733388300\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a quaint seaside English village, get to know the local faces and control the spread of information from the comfort of your favourite legally distinct operating system, Half Frame OS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real life, &quot;Jobsworth Weekly&quot; lets you release 12 editions of the newsletter stretching across many local festivals and traditions. You will have to decide what is deserving of attention and live with the consequences.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749340/extras/3dc450f96baa70a7ae14659f678c2c25.avif?t=1733388300\" width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Congratulations!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the latest parish council meeting we have unanimously agreed that you are to be editor-in-chief of our  community newsletter &quot;Jobsworth Weekly&quot;. Adhere to the publishing guidelines and make decisions with great consideration for the future of the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A true slice of Middle England</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749340/extras/a2856562d7cf7676ef9ddc735cf38131.avif?t=1733388300\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a quaint seaside English village, get to know the local faces and control the spread of information from the comfort of your favourite legally distinct operating system, Half Frame OS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real life, &quot;Jobsworth Weekly&quot; lets you release 12 editions of the newsletter stretching across many local festivals and traditions. You will have to decide what is deserving of attention and live with the consequences.</p>",
